#   gemini-3.1-pro-preview   ← default (latest, cutting-edge)
#   gemini-2.5-pro           (stable, best accuracy)
#   gemini-2.5-flash         (fast, lower cost)
#   gemini-3-flash-preview   (fast, latest)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-pro-preview
